# Commit Messages

**Formato:** `type(scope?): subject`; opcional body; footer `Refs MAT-123` ou `Closes MAT-123`. Type: feat|fix|chore|docs|style|refactor|test|perf. Subject: imperativo, minúsculo, ~50–72 chars, sem ponto final. Um cambio lógico por commit.

<example>
✅ feat(auth): add email OTP step
✅ fix(dashboard): handle empty list
❌ Fixed bug in login
❌ feat: add stuff and also fix the form
</example>
